  "prefLabel": "Gen 103.02 Responsibilities of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 103.02 Responsibilities of the Board. The board has the responsibility to:\n\n(a) Establish the requirements to license genetic counselors;\n\n(b) Establish the requirements to provisionally license people to practice genetic counseling and the requirements for direction and supervision of their practice;\n\n(c) Establish the eligibility to renew the licenses of genetic counselors; and\n\n(d) Establish the limitations on practice imposed on provisional licensees.\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #13554, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 103.04); ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26 (formerly Gen 103.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen100.html"
